property_value: editor_note "Look for \"mineral\" in a chemical or geochemical ontology to formalise the composed primarily of link.\nFrom https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ [A mineral] is different from a rock, which can be an aggregate of minerals or non-minerals and does not have a specific chemical composition. The exact definition of a mineral is under debate, especially with respect to the requirement a valid species be abiogenic, and to a lesser extent with regards to it having an ordered atomic structure." xsd:string

