is_a: ENVO:01000343 ! altitudinal condition

[Term]
id: ENVO:01000343
name: altitudinal condition
def: "An altitudinal condition is an environmental condition in which ranges of factors such as temperature, humidity, soil composition, solar irradiation, and tree density vary with ranges in altitude." [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Altitudinal_zonation]
is_a: ENVO:01000203 ! environmental condition

