[Term]
id: ENVO:01000930
name: ecological corridor
def: "An ecosystem which bridges two or more adjoining ecosystems and through which organisms may move or propagate." [http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/10510, https://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/3756]
synonym: "animal corridor" RELATED []
synonym: "green corridor" RELATED []
