relationship: RO:0002234 ENVO:01000313 ! has output anthropogenic environment

[Term]
id: ENVO:01000958
name: terrestrial planet
def: "A planet that is composed primarily of silicate rocks or metals." [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Terrestrial_planet]
