[Term]
id: ENVO:01001137
name: ice planet
def: "A planet which has a surface layer that nearly completely or completely covered by ice, and which has a substantial portion of its mass composed of ice." [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ice_planet]
synonym: "cryoplanet" EXACT []
is_a: ENVO:01000800 ! planet

