[Term]
id: NBO:0020182
name: escalation
def: "Increasing intensity of directed agonistic behavior." []
is_a: NBO:0000121 ! agonistic behavior

[Term]
id: NBO:0020220
name: exclusion
def: "Behavior that serves to exlude an animal from a group." []
is_a: NBO:0000121 ! agonistic behavior

[Term]
id: NBO:0020239
name: triumph
def: "Display behavior by the winner of a prior agonistic contest." []
is_a: NBO:0000121 ! agonistic behavior

[Term]
id: NBO:0020253
name: mating appeasement
def: "Behavior that serves to demonstrate non-aggressive intent by one member of a courting or potentially mating pair to the other." []
is_a: NBO:0000077 ! courtship behavior

[Term]
id: NBO:0020254
name: sexual harassment
def: "Any of several behaviors directed towards one animal unwilling to mate by another eager to do so." []
is_a: NBO:0000010 ! reproductive behavior

[Term]
id: NBO:0020255
name: displacement behavior
def: "An acitvity that seems irrelevant to its behavioral context to a human observer and often occurs when its performer is in a conflict situation." []
is_a: NBO:0000121 ! agonistic behavior

[Term]
id: NBO:0020264
name: courtship feeding
def: "Provision of food to a potential mate" []
is_a: NBO:0000077 ! courtship behavior

[Term]
id: NBO:0020273
name: breeding site selection
def: "Actions resulting in establishment or use of one locale for reproductive activity." []
is_a: NBO:0000014 ! mating behavior

[Term]
id: NBO:0020279
name: appeasement
def: "Behaviors that appear to signifiy lack of hostility and to reduce chances of attack." []
is_a: NBO:0000121 ! agonistic behavior

[Term]
id: NBO:0020298
name: sexual interference
def: "Usually interference by members of one sex in the completion of courtship or mating activities by one or more members of the same sex." []
is_a: NBO:0000010 ! reproductive behavior

[Term]
id: NBO:0020299
name: mate rejection
