subset: uberon_slim
synonym: "sinew" RELATED [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tendon]
synonym: "sinew" RELATED [Wikipedia:Tendon]
synonym: "tendo" RELATED LATIN [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tendon]
