property_value: UBPROP:0000001 "The endothelium is the thin layer of cells that lines the interior surface of blood vessels, forming an interface between circulating blood in the lumen and the rest of the vessel wall.[AAO]" xsd:string {date_retrieved="2012-06-20", external_class="AAO:0011013", ontology="AAO", source="XAO:curator"}
