relationship: composed_primarily_of CL:0000333 {notes="pre migratory https://github.com/obophenotype/uberon/wiki/The-neural-crest"} ! migratory neural crest cell
relationship: develops_from UBERON:0005062 {source="http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/11523831"} ! neural fold
