def: "Muscle tissue is a contractile tissue made up of actin and myosin fibers[GO]." [GO:0060537, http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Muscle_tissue, https://sourceforge.net/tracker/index.php?func=detail&aid=2801266&group_id=36855&atid=440764]
