synonym: "stroma ovarica" EXACT [FMA:18626]
synonym: "stroma ovarii" RELATED LATIN [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stroma_of_ovary]
xref: CALOHA:TS-1246
xref: EMAPA:28880
xref: FMA:18626
