xref: FMA:20107
is_a: UBERON:0002384 {source="FMA"} ! connective tissue

[Term]
id: UBERON:0011822
name: dense irregular connective tissue
namespace: uberon
def: "Irregular connective tissue is an irregular connective tissue, the intercellular matrix of which contains a dense irregular network of collagen and elastic fiber bundles. Examples: connective tissue of peritoneum, connective tissue of fibrous pericardium." [FMA:20109, http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dense_irregular_connective_tissue]
synonym: "irregular dense connective tissue" EXACT []
synonym: "typus irregularis (textus connectivus collagenosus compactus)" EXACT [FMA:20109]
