is_a: UBERON:0011822 {source="FMA"} ! dense irregular connective tissue
relationship: bounding_layer_of UBERON:0014892 ! skeletal muscle organ
relationship: continuous_with UBERON:0000043 ! tendon
relationship: part_of UBERON:0001134 {source="FMA"} ! skeletal muscle tissue
property_value: UBPROP:0000009 "The Epimysium also protects muscles from friction against other muscles and bones" xsd:string

